    <h2 class="author-name">Reverend Rowan Crossbar</h2>
    <p class="author-bio">
      Rowan once scored a hat-trick in a five-a-side friendly and has dined out on it for eleven years. He writes about tactics with the serene confidence of a man who has never successfully coached anything larger than a Subbuteo XI. He lives above a defunct sports bar, which he describes, without irony, as &ldquo;dwelling above my church.&rdquo;
    </p>
